      "spam": false,
      "value": "This would be nice. Maybe someone has a condition that others should know about, such as being mute or shy (reason not to use mic), doesn't have a mic/VR, or wants to write a short description of their avatar publicly (as the avatar description when uploading doesn't seem to show). Being able to link to our own worlds could be neat too, then people like myself could post links to our worlds.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
